<!-- T123 --> <div class="t123"> <div class="t-container_100 "> <div class="t-width t-width_100 "> <!-- nominify begin --> <!-- Секция 06: Программа курса --> <!-- Шрифт: настройки HEAD страницы --> <!-- Секция 01: Программа курса --> <div class="academy-page eating-disorders-page" data-eating-disorders-part> <section class="section_learning section-spacing_component" id="eating-disorders-program" aria-labelledby="eating-disorders-program-heading"> <div class="padding-global"> <div class="container-xlarge"> <div class="column-grid_component"> <div class="column-grid_content is-content-wide section-layout_component is-responsive"> <div class="section-header_component is-center is-responsive"> <div class="section-header_title"> <h2 class="section-title_component is-responsive" id="eating-disorders-program-heading">Программа курса</h2> </div> </div> <div class="learning-timeline_component is-program"> <ol class="learning-timeline_list" aria-label="Модули программы" data-learning-timeline data-accordion> <li class="learning-timeline_step"> <span class="learning-timeline_marker" aria-hidden="true">1</span> <div class="card_component is-stage is-lesson"> <details class="stage-card_disclosure accordion_item" data-accordion-item open> <summary class="stage-card_summary" data-accordion-trigger> <h3 class="stage-card_header"> <span class="stage-card_badge">Модуль 1. 31 ак. ч.</span><span class="content-heading_component is-card stage-card_heading">Современные представления о РПП и диагностика</span> </h3> <span class="accordion_icon toggle-icon_component stage-card_toggle" aria-hidden="true"><span class="toggle-icon_glyph"></span></span> </summary> <div class="accordion_panel" data-accordion-panel> <div class="stage-card_details"> <ul class="stage-card_questions stage-card_description"> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Изучите современные представления о РПП и подходы к их лечению.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Разберёте диагностические критерии и особенности разных расстройств пищевого поведения.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Освоите проведение диагностического интервью и научитесь выявлять признаки РПП.</span> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </details> </div> </li> <li class="learning-timeline_step"> <span class="learning-timeline_marker" aria-hidden="true">2</span> <div class="card_component is-stage is-lesson"> <details class="stage-card_disclosure accordion_item" data-accordion-item> <summary class="stage-card_summary" data-accordion-trigger> <h3 class="stage-card_header"> <span class="stage-card_badge">Модуль 2. 43 ак. ч.</span><span class="content-heading_component is-card stage-card_heading">Начало терапии и организация помощи при РПП</span> </h3> <span class="accordion_icon toggle-icon_component stage-card_toggle" aria-hidden="true"><span class="toggle-icon_glyph"></span></span> </summary> <div class="accordion_panel" data-accordion-panel> <div class="stage-card_details"> <ul class="stage-card_questions stage-card_description"> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Изучите основные этапы терапии и принципы организации помощи.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Научитесь работать с амбивалентностью клиента и поддерживать его мотивацию к изменениям.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Разберётесь в принципах восстановительного питания и освоите план питания «Правило трёх» Марши Херрин.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Изучите особенности ARFID и медицинские аспекты сопровождения клиентов с РПП.</span> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </details> </div> </li> <li class="learning-timeline_step"> <span class="learning-timeline_marker" aria-hidden="true">3</span> <div class="card_component is-stage is-lesson"> <details class="stage-card_disclosure accordion_item" data-accordion-item> <summary class="stage-card_summary" data-accordion-trigger> <h3 class="stage-card_header"> <span class="stage-card_badge">Модуль 3. 56 ак. ч.</span><span class="content-heading_component is-card stage-card_heading">Расширенная когнитивно-поведенческая терапия (CBT-E)</span> </h3> <span class="accordion_icon toggle-icon_component stage-card_toggle" aria-hidden="true"><span class="toggle-icon_glyph"></span></span> </summary> <div class="accordion_panel" data-accordion-panel> <div class="stage-card_details"> <ul class="stage-card_questions stage-card_description"> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Освоите пошаговую структуру CBT-E и научитесь планировать терапевтические сессии.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Научитесь строить концептуализацию случая и определять мишени терапии.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Разберёте методы работы с пищевыми ограничениями, компенсаторным поведением, образом тела и изменениями настроения.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Освоите проведение поведенческих экспериментов.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Изучите расширенный протокол CBT-E: работу с перфекционизмом, низкой самооценкой и межличностными трудностями.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Разберёте клинические случаи на супервизии.</span> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </details> </div> </li> <li class="learning-timeline_step"> <span class="learning-timeline_marker" aria-hidden="true">4</span> <div class="card_component is-stage is-lesson"> <details class="stage-card_disclosure accordion_item" data-accordion-item> <summary class="stage-card_summary" data-accordion-trigger> <h3 class="stage-card_header"> <span class="stage-card_badge">Модуль 4. 63 ак. ч.</span><span class="content-heading_component is-card stage-card_heading">Терапия принятия и ответственности (ACT) в работе с РПП</span> </h3> <span class="accordion_icon toggle-icon_component stage-card_toggle" aria-hidden="true"><span class="toggle-icon_glyph"></span></span> </summary> <div class="accordion_panel" data-accordion-panel> <div class="stage-card_details"> <ul class="stage-card_questions stage-card_description"> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Изучите теоретические основы ACT и освоите модель гексафлекса.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Научитесь проводить функциональную оценку и строить концептуализацию случаев РПП в ACT.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Освоите методы работы с когнитивным разделением, принятием, контактом с настоящим и готовностью к сложным переживаниям.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Научитесь работать с ценностями, образом тела и принципами бодинейтральности.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Разберёте особенности завершения терапии и способы работы с личными профессиональными трудностями.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Разберёте клинические случаи на супервизии.</span> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </details> </div> </li> <li class="learning-timeline_step"> <span class="learning-timeline_marker" aria-hidden="true">5</span> <div class="card_component is-stage is-lesson"> <details class="stage-card_disclosure accordion_item" data-accordion-item> <summary class="stage-card_summary" data-accordion-trigger> <h3 class="stage-card_header"> <span class="stage-card_badge">Модуль 5. 29 ак. ч.</span><span class="content-heading_component is-card stage-card_heading">Навыки при работе с РПП</span> </h3> <span class="accordion_icon toggle-icon_component stage-card_toggle" aria-hidden="true"><span class="toggle-icon_glyph"></span></span> </summary> <div class="accordion_panel" data-accordion-panel> <div class="stage-card_details"> <ul class="stage-card_questions stage-card_description"> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Освоите навыки осознанности и эмоциональной регуляции.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Изучите и попрактикуете техники эффективного решения проблем и повышения устойчивости к стрессу.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Научитесь обучать клиентов этим навыкам в процессе терапии.</span> </li> <li class="body-text_component is-detailed stage-card_question"> <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR4nGNgYGBgAAAABQABpfZFQAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==" width="20" height="20" alt="" draggable="false"><span>Изучите особенности РПП у детей и подростков, подходы к лечению и профилактике.</span> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </details> </div> </li> </ol> <a class="button_component button is-accent learning-timeline_action" href="#program" data-tilda-popup-link>Получить полную программу</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> </div> <!-- nominify end --> </div> </div> </div>
</div>
